dotengine/godot/pull/115119.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-04T17:23:55Z"},"body":"Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/82965\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/16832\r\n\r\nAlso fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115110\r\n\r\nThis PR is based on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/82965 and this PR addresses the problems pointed out in the reviews of the original PR, particularly that the `Input` class shouldn't depend on `DisplayServer` and the PR should also handle multiple windows.\r\nThis PR adds a project setting that allows the joypad events to be ignored if the application (or any of its windows) is unfocused.\r\nIf the project setting is enabled and the application is not in focus, joypad LED and motion sensors are ignored and vibration is stopped too.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/991d8564-bd2d-45dd-9350-232eea561c48\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9988dbf1-cf8b-49af-add4-3e66593e8ab6\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Add a Godot Docs input tutorial note ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11680 )\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type"